# WP4.3: mutmut 3 run cache (generated sources + verdict metas). The
# score HISTORY is committed (.github/mutation-history.json) -- the cache
# is regenerable; the series is not. mutmut-verdicts.tar.gz is the CI/
# local verdict pack (metas+stats only); 2026-09-22 renamed it off the
# dotfile so upload-artifact (include-hidden-files:false default) ships it.
mutants/
mutmut-verdicts.tar.gz
.mutmut-restored-metas
.mutmut-metas-now

# WP3.3: stryker sandbox + HTML mutation report (regenerable; the score
# itself is ledger-recorded, the sandbox copy of the repo is not evidence).
.stryker-tmp/
frontend/reports/mutation/

# Local dev PID files (dev.sh recreates the dir; untracked since 2026-09-21 cleanup)
.pids/
